# DIT-OS VFS and ramfs

Before editing matching files, read `.agents/skills/filesystem-vfs/SKILL.md` and follow
it. Also apply `AGENTS.md` (definition of done, handoff, hard rules) and the
mandatory `.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md` for every code change.
Content lives in the skill; this file only points to it.

Never forget:
- Syscalls go through fs::vfs_*, never a driver directly.
- Only vfs.cpp and ramfs are implemented; many fs headers are declarations only.
- Check offset + size for overflow; clamp .. at root; zero dirents.
